    "enUS": {
      "description": "Some may speak with you now, but not all. For more of our tribe to be what you know as friend, you must not rush.\r\n\r\nStay by our side, work with our young and old, and guard us from those who wish us harm.\r\n\r\nWhen you have more to bring to us, we will have more to share.",
